; When valuing a balance fails for several of its commodities, -V and -X
; (with one target commodity or several) report the failure of the
; commodity the balance lists first, on every run, and report it once,
; valuing no commodity twice.
;
; The `value` expressions of AAA and BBB call functions that do not exist,
; so valuing Assets:Broker, which holds both, fails, and the error names
; AAA's foo_aaa.  Assets:Lots holds lots of CCC and DDD whose valuations,
; written on the lots, fail the same way, and the error names CCC's
; foo_ccc.  Ledger used to value the components in the order in which the
; balance happened to keep them and report the first failure it met, so
; the function an error named followed that order rather than the
; commodities.

commodity AAA
    value foo_aaa(amount)

commodity BBB
    value foo_bbb(amount)

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker    1 AAA
    Assets:Broker    1 BBB
    Equity

2024/01/01 Buy lots
    Assets:Lots      1 CCC {$1} ((foo_ccc(amount)))
    Assets:Lots      1 DDD {$1} ((foo_ddd(amount)))
    Equity

test bal -V --now 2030/06/15 Assets:Broker -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  foo_aaa(amount)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While calling function 'market (1 AAA ((foo_aaa(amount)))
1 BBB ((foo_bbb(amount))), 2030/06/15 00:00:00, )':
Error: Unknown identifier 'foo_aaa'
end test

test bal -X $ --now 2030/06/15 Assets:Broker -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  foo_aaa(amount)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While calling function 'market (1 AAA ((foo_aaa(amount)))
1 BBB ((foo_bbb(amount))), 2030/06/15 00:00:00, $)':
Error: Unknown identifier 'foo_aaa'
end test

test bal -X '$,EUR' --now 2030/06/15 Assets:Broker -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  foo_aaa(amount)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While calling function 'market (1 AAA ((foo_aaa(amount)))
1 BBB ((foo_bbb(amount))), 2030/06/15 00:00:00, $,EUR)':
Error: Unknown identifier 'foo_aaa'
end test

test bal -V --now 2030/06/15 Assets:Lots -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  foo_ccc(amount)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While calling function 'market (1 CCC {$1} ((foo_ccc(amount)))
1 DDD {$1} ((foo_ddd(amount))), 2030/06/15 00:00:00, )':
Error: Unknown identifier 'foo_ccc'
end test

test bal -X $ --now 2030/06/15 Assets:Lots -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  foo_ccc(amount)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While calling function 'market (1 CCC {$1} ((foo_ccc(amount)))
1 DDD {$1} ((foo_ddd(amount))), 2030/06/15 00:00:00, $)':
Error: Unknown identifier 'foo_ccc'
end test
